export anchor Y2KBubbleStyle:
    number: 26
    screen: LandingPage
    name: Y2K bubble
    idea: Late-90s web optimism, with bubbly chrome-silver capsules, glossy pill buttons, iridescent pastel edges and little star sparkles.
    base: light
    palette:
        haze: #eef0ff, the page base under faint pink, blue and mint glows
        midnight: #1c1b4d, text and headings
        dusk: #4a4880, secondary text and notes
        gelBlue: #3a5ff0 to #1b34a8, the glossy primary pill and the window title strip
        linkBlue: #2b45d4, links
        chrome: #ffffff, #c9cfe0 and #8f97b3, the top bar, capsules and secondary pills as a banded silver gradient
        iris: #ffd6f5, #d6e9ff, #d9ffef and #fff1c9, card rings and the quote bubble
        magenta: #b0207a, small headings and the focus glow, with #e0389b for sparkles
        jade: #0f6b45, the On track gem
        amber: #8a4b00, the At risk gem
        cherry: #b3123a, the Overdue gem
    type:
        Headings and labels use Arial Rounded MT Bold, Trebuchet MS,
        Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif in bold. Body uses Verdana, Tahoma,
        Lucida Grande, sans-serif. The headline is 76px at 1.02 line height
        with minus 0.03em tracking, a white emboss shadow, and its second
        half in a dark violet to blue to plum gradient. Section titles are
        46px, the quote 36px, feature titles 21px, the lede 18px, body 15px
        at 1.65 and chips 12px.
    layout:
        A floating chrome capsule top bar with a glass orb logo, a sunken
        segmented control for the nav and a glossy blue Start free pill.
        The hero is split, with an iridescent badge, the headline, lede,
        buttons and note on the left, and on the right a chrome device
        bezel holding a white window with a glossy blue title strip and
        three project rows with status gems. Star sparkles float nearby.
        The logo strip is a centred row of soft glossy capsules. Three
        feature cards have iridescent gradient rings, a white gloss strip
        and a glossy colour sphere icon. The quote is an iridescent speech
        bubble with a tail pointing down at an orb avatar. The closing band
        is a huge chrome capsule with the line and a pill. The footer is a
        pale silver gradient. Below 960px the hero stacks, and below 720px
        the nav drops to a full width second row inside the capsule.
    spacing: An 8px unit with 24 to 28px gaps and roomy 72 to 96px section padding.
    density: Airy and toy-like. Short lines, big rounded shapes, one idea per capsule.
    corners: Everything bubbly. Pills at 999px, cards 36px, the device bezel 40px, the quote bubble 48px.
    borders: 1px silver #8f97b3 around chrome, 3px iridescent gradient rings around cards, 1px white highlights on top edges.
    shadows: Soft drops of 0 16px 40px rgba(28,27,77,0.12), inner shading at the bottom, and a white gloss strip over the top half of every pill and card.
    icons:
        Thick round 2.4 stroke white glyphs inside glossy 84px spheres with
        a light spot. Status gems sit in white pills, a round tick for On
        track, a diamond with an exclamation mark for At risk and a rounded
        square with a cross for Overdue, beside the word.
    focus: A white 3px ring, then a 3px magenta ring and a soft magenta glow.
    tone: Upbeat and bouncy, such as Everything bubbles up to one page and My projects.
